{"id":1393,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>3月16日14:00，“2026年度东方航空技术有限公司飞机维修工程师招聘”专场宣讲会在01207H教室成功举办，吸引航空航天类、机械类、电气类等相关专业近百名应届毕业生到场参加。</p><p>宣讲会上，东航技术西北分公司招聘负责人介绍了公司发展历程，并对飞机维修工程师岗位的职责及招聘条件进行详细解读。本次招聘面向应届本科理工类毕业生，航空宇航学院相关专业学生在专业对口度、实践能力培养及行业认可度方面具有显著优势，深受用人单位青睐。</p><p>此次宣讲会为同学们搭建了与企业面对面交流的平台，进一步深化了校企合作。</p><p>报名截止时间：2026年6月30日17:00</p><p>报名通道： <a href=\"http://job.ceair.com/JobDetail.html?positionId=NTA1Nw==&cateId=NDAwMA==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">http://job.ceair.com/JobDetail.html?positionId=NTA1Nw==&amp;cateId=NDAwMA==</a></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CUNLQaUzlZLmA7oqlM7LNnkolVVozUpsM87bMm98M77ZMRl0gihFp2hmCIa0okh7U1y4nSyanmf2U4CbM7M2nz9aMlUiLRV7Um-8nNL4LzfFUmvbnRA2nzrFU4UZUlLJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUsg4NPM4vJqdvnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1047&nid=9177&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8DB3E0F0FC694CFE805D501DB24FC310/B79D8FE5/C48AC\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CMNQQ2Mmv4oRQ2LqmA2nlrfM4L4MR-pDUNr2olQkM4MkolU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyaUSyaMkysLRlsoRlYM7MkU4ffozN8LzlDn7nVozUsLzWFUmVkM8nfolVFLmLioRlDgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzG8MYybLzvsgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1047&nid=9177&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CL8QQ2oR6VnmGPMqmf7MNCio7nkUmCpinzGDnzffL4WVM8U0gihFp2hmCIa0LShkLSy8UYh2LzrknRNbM4M7nmGZMm9aL774Um9bnmlaL4AFL878nN-aU4rFoz7inN7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUsg4NPM4vJqdvnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1047&nid=9177&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1B14CF15BD9973DF086800A3B89F5038/3A4FB0C5/915FA\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Cn7CQiU4MRUznknqm6VL8n2MRQknz9pPLlMfUllbLzL4LRN0gihFp2hmCIa0LShVLSyZLYyYL4lsMmn2ozG4MzvbnR6VMRQRL4GsU8-PMlrFLNn2LlVRU8WFLlMRUm74gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzG8MYybLzvsgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1047&nid=9177&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CUNLQaUzlZLmA7oqlM7LNnkolVVozUpsM87bMm98M77ZMRl0gihFp2hmCIa0okh7U1y4nSyanmf2U4CbM7